## 7.6 Changing from sparkline to sparkbar

Instead of displaying the values as sparklines, we can also display them as sparkbars.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="show the code"}
reactable(
  report,
  defaultPageSize = 13,
  columns = list(
    Product = colDef(maxWidth = 200),
    `Monthly Sales` = colDef(
      cell = react_sparkbar(
        report,
        highlight_bars = highlight_bars(
          min = "red", max = "blue"),
        bandline = "innerquartiles",
        statline = "mean")
    )
  )
)
```

